WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.060 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 14=

01:57.400 --> 01:58.140
Be careful.

01:58.140 --> 01:58.880
Stop there.

01:58.880 --> 01:59.480
Yes, there.

01:59.840 --> 02:00.540
Chief Wang,

02:00.890 --> 02:01.920
you bought a new cabinet?

02:02.940 --> 02:04.090
It's a TV cabinet.

02:04.090 --> 02:05.720
We'll come over to watch TV then.

02:05.720 --> 02:07.440
Sure, please come.

02:08.250 --> 02:09.410
Everyone's welcome.

02:09.410 --> 02:11.640
Ms. Wang, I want
to watch TV at your place, too.

02:11.640 --> 02:13.020
- Sure. You can come together.
- Me too.

02:13.020 --> 02:14.060
You can all come together.

02:14.060 --> 02:14.830
Go and play.

02:16.340 --> 02:17.360
You bought a new cabinet?

02:17.670 --> 02:18.240
Fei Ni.

02:19.530 --> 02:20.650
My new cabinet.

02:20.900 --> 02:22.620
It's specially for the TV.

02:23.940 --> 02:25.250
I'm waiting for Fang Muyang

02:25.530 --> 02:26.740
to get that TV coupon,

02:26.740 --> 02:28.137
and then I can use it right away.

02:29.410 --> 02:30.850
Chen's retirement report

02:30.850 --> 02:31.740
has been approved.

02:31.940 --> 02:33.740
Chen's retiring in a couple of days.

02:34.300 --> 02:35.530
We made a deal.

02:35.790 --> 02:36.540
Now

02:36.671 --> 02:37.880
there aren't many days left.

02:40.900 --> 02:41.626
I'll get going.

02:42.410 --> 02:42.970
Come.

02:42.970 --> 02:44.090
That's the glass panel, right?

02:44.090 --> 02:44.500
Okay.

02:44.500 --> 02:45.130
I'll carry it.

02:45.130 --> 02:46.130
Go ahead. This way.

02:46.130 --> 02:47.040
Watch your step.

02:47.040 --> 02:47.900
Yes.

02:47.900 --> 02:48.570
Okay.

02:48.850 --> 02:49.460
Slowly.

02:49.460 --> 02:50.050
Beside you.

02:51.060 --> 02:51.900
Careful.

02:51.900 --> 02:53.080
Yes. Behind you.

02:53.130 --> 02:54.240
Watch your step. Behind you.

03:00.220 --> 03:01.200
(Fei Ni,)

03:01.500 --> 03:03.180
(you eat rice one bite at a time.)

03:03.300 --> 03:04.720
(You walk the road step by step.)

03:05.180 --> 03:06.620
(Don't you know)

03:06.810 --> 03:08.130
(how much you can afford?)

03:08.340 --> 03:08.850
Ting,

03:09.460 --> 03:10.850
it won't work this time.

03:11.610 --> 03:12.740
I can't help you.

03:14.410 --> 03:15.760
Why are you back so late?

03:16.850 --> 03:18.070
What's that?

03:24.740 --> 03:26.090
206 Manual Turntable.

03:26.690 --> 03:27.810
It may look a bit old,

03:28.820 --> 03:29.980
but it sounds fine.

03:30.700 --> 03:32.210
Why are you wasting money again?

03:32.210 --> 03:33.300
Weren't we saving?

03:33.300 --> 03:34.380
Don't get worked up yet.

03:34.540 --> 03:35.610
I didn't buy it.

03:35.820 --> 03:36.700
I borrowed it.

03:37.020 --> 03:37.450
You...

03:38.170 --> 03:40.170
What if someone finds out?

03:41.170 --> 03:41.860
Five minutes.

03:42.020 --> 03:42.820
Just five minutes.

04:06.700 --> 04:07.490
How is it?

04:08.140 --> 04:09.820
I took a long time to pick this record.

04:10.140 --> 04:11.050
Do you like it?

04:11.980 --> 04:12.820
Mozart?

04:13.300 --> 04:13.770
Yeah.

04:32.500 --> 04:36.700
♪Time quietly reveals♪

04:37.180 --> 04:40.740
♪Those rising heartbeats♪

04:41.580 --> 04:45.340
♪In my eyes, there's always a rainbow♪

04:45.820 --> 04:48.820
♪Paving the road to our dreams♪

04:48.980 --> 04:53.060
♪Those days and nights we shared♪

04:53.620 --> 04:57.100
♪Are etched deep in memory♪

04:57.700 --> 05:00.860
♪How I wish I could
write everything down♪

05:01.300 --> 05:05.780
♪Your care, my love♪

05:08.780 --> 05:13.140
♪Because of you♪

05:13.260 --> 05:15.660
♪The ordinary days in my world♪

05:15.820 --> 05:19.260
♪Turn bright♪

05:19.540 --> 05:22.580
♪Rich and precious♪

05:23.060 --> 05:25.500
♪How I wish I could♪

05:25.660 --> 05:27.860
♪Be a firefly for you in the night♪

05:28.020 --> 05:29.460
♪Guiding you toward the horizon♪

05:29.540 --> 05:32.100
♪As you go to see a wider world♪

05:32.220 --> 05:35.580
♪How lucky we are
to have chosen each other♪

05:35.700 --> 05:39.100
♪Our hearts shine for each other♪

05:39.220 --> 05:41.780
♪Let me become♪

05:41.860 --> 05:44.060
♪A firework that shines for you forever♪

05:44.260 --> 05:45.820
♪Burning with endless light♪

05:45.980 --> 05:48.260
♪I'll tell our story with my life♪

05:48.380 --> 05:51.740
♪Stars lean into the twilight,
you lean on me♪

05:52.140 --> 05:57.020
♪For the rest of our lives,
let's not count the years♪

05:58.061 --> 06:02.101
♪I'll walk beside you♪

06:08.020 --> 06:09.530
I want to hear it again.

06:10.410 --> 06:11.180
Again?

06:12.248 --> 06:13.450
We've played it three times.

06:14.210 --> 06:14.880
It's late.

06:17.580 --> 06:18.930
Maybe I'll get another record.

06:19.604 --> 06:20.737
We can listen to it later.

06:22.210 --> 06:22.700
Okay.

06:24.770 --> 06:26.820
Return it first thing tomorrow morning.

06:26.820 --> 06:28.020
Keeping this here

06:28.620 --> 06:29.580
is too dangerous.

06:30.290 --> 06:31.060
Right.

06:32.260 --> 06:33.180
I'll return it now.

06:33.180 --> 06:33.970
Now?

06:34.210 --> 06:34.620
Yes.

06:41.290 --> 06:41.840
I'm leaving.

06:53.410 --> 06:53.850
Well...

06:55.330 --> 06:56.210
It's late now.

06:57.290 --> 06:58.450
Where is he taking it?

07:27.940 --> 07:28.740
Gao.

07:32.740 --> 07:33.804
We can dismantle it now.

07:41.380 --> 07:41.970
Fei Ni?

07:48.540 --> 07:50.715
(Black-And-White TV Receiver
Repair and Adjustment)

07:52.180 --> 07:53.560
You mean

07:53.970 --> 07:55.790
you assemble a TV yourself?

07:56.210 --> 07:57.060
Not just me,

07:57.700 --> 07:58.410
Engineer Gao too.

07:58.620 --> 07:59.410
It's Gao.

08:00.530 --> 08:01.680
Just call me Gao.

08:05.500 --> 08:06.760
Why do you look

08:07.770 --> 08:09.240
so familiar?

08:12.740 --> 08:13.850
I don't recall.

08:16.620 --> 08:17.090
Fei Ni.

08:17.737 --> 08:20.240
Gao is a key technician
at the No. 2 Electromechanical Factory.

08:20.410 --> 08:21.380
He did us a huge favor.

08:21.650 --> 08:22.970
He got all these parts, too.

08:23.290 --> 08:24.260
Fang,

08:24.530 --> 08:25.280
enough.

08:25.530 --> 08:26.650
You'll sell me out.

08:26.850 --> 08:28.090
Don't be nervous.

08:28.620 --> 08:29.650
Fei Ni is my wife.

08:29.790 --> 08:31.182
She's also the person I trust most.

08:31.382 --> 08:32.380
She won't tell anyone.

08:37.671 --> 08:38.560
Fang Muyang.

08:39.137 --> 08:40.493
I'm stepping out for a second.

08:45.930 --> 08:47.530
So the manual turntable

08:47.530 --> 08:49.460
was for assembling the TV?

08:50.770 --> 08:51.730
I didn't know that.

08:51.730 --> 08:52.820
I even scolded you.

08:53.170 --> 08:53.700
Sorry.

08:55.290 --> 08:55.740
It's okay.

08:56.382 --> 08:57.715
I was afraid it wouldn't work

08:57.737 --> 08:59.730
and didn't want you to get your hopes up
for nothing,

08:59.782 --> 09:01.160
so I didn't tell you about it.

09:02.460 --> 09:04.380
There are so many parts.

09:04.620 --> 09:05.690
They must've cost a lot.

09:05.930 --> 09:07.260
Where did the money come from?

09:07.460 --> 09:08.980
I borrowed it from Uncle Fu.

09:09.050 --> 09:10.800
Return the money quickly.

09:11.290 --> 09:13.190
We can afford the parts ourselves.

09:14.830 --> 09:15.140
Okay.

09:17.890 --> 09:19.530
What can I help with?

09:20.140 --> 09:20.690
No need.

09:21.100 --> 09:22.220
You have work tomorrow.

09:22.380 --> 09:23.410
Go back and sleep.

09:23.690 --> 09:24.290
No.

09:24.930 --> 09:26.170
We're husband and wife.

09:26.170 --> 09:27.220
We should share the burden.

09:28.140 --> 09:29.260
I don't know much,

09:29.570 --> 09:30.930
but I can help out a little.

09:31.340 --> 09:32.380
Pass the tools,

09:32.690 --> 09:33.500
or if you get hungry,

09:33.500 --> 09:34.715
I'll cook something good.

09:35.170 --> 09:35.980
Sure.

09:39.380 --> 09:40.040
Come, Gao.

09:53.530 --> 09:54.220
Here.

09:54.500 --> 09:55.100
Fang Muyang.

09:55.520 --> 09:56.140
Gao.

09:56.382 --> 09:57.140
Food's ready.

09:57.690 --> 09:58.170
Okay.

10:00.930 --> 10:01.620
I'll help.

10:03.190 --> 10:04.680
Wash your hands first.

10:05.900 --> 10:09.020
♪Don't think too far ahead♪

10:09.100 --> 10:12.460
♪Just work hard for today♪

10:12.820 --> 10:16.140
♪Learn from the sun, how warm it is♪

10:16.300 --> 10:20.020
♪Light up the corners that need it♪

10:20.180 --> 10:22.980
♪The ones who smile the most♪

10:23.060 --> 10:25.260
♪Gain the most in return♪

10:26.580 --> 10:29.820
♪I want a life that's real♪

10:30.060 --> 10:33.380
♪Steady, feet on solid ground♪

10:33.700 --> 10:36.940
♪Slowly, our paths begin to cross♪

10:37.260 --> 10:40.300
♪Each day holds something
to look forward to♪

10:40.580 --> 10:43.700
♪Live it real♪

10:43.900 --> 10:47.140
♪Two people, three meals, four seasons♪

10:47.580 --> 10:50.660
♪Collecting ordinary moments in life♪

10:50.860 --> 10:53.060
♪Making them into memories♪

10:55.300 --> 10:58.740
(Teaching Building)

11:02.650 --> 11:03.220
Fang.

11:05.220 --> 11:05.770
Professor Wu.

11:08.170 --> 11:09.020
We're about

11:09.020 --> 11:10.570
to be transferred to our new posts.

11:11.140 --> 11:12.050
You and Qu Hua

11:12.050 --> 11:13.380
will be living apart.

11:13.770 --> 11:16.020
Have you talked to him?

11:17.220 --> 11:18.530
Not yet.

11:21.380 --> 11:22.570
You're leaving soon,

11:22.582 --> 11:24.048
and you still haven't told him?

11:24.810 --> 11:26.220
I've made my decision anyway.

11:26.500 --> 11:27.500
Sooner or later

11:27.570 --> 11:28.620
makes no difference.

11:29.980 --> 11:30.740
Fang,

11:31.100 --> 11:32.810
I know you care a lot about your career.

11:33.100 --> 11:35.460
But you have to balance
career and family.

11:36.410 --> 11:37.570
Don't worry, Professor Wu.

11:37.570 --> 11:38.570
I can handle it.

11:39.382 --> 11:40.115
Alright.

11:40.220 --> 11:41.170
I'll get back to work.

12:28.650 --> 12:29.520
You're home.

12:36.050 --> 12:36.860
Qu Hua...

12:39.020 --> 12:40.810
There's something
I need to apologize for.

12:43.890 --> 12:46.220
My project team has merged
with Jiangcheng University.

12:47.020 --> 12:48.570
I'm transferring with them.

12:48.740 --> 12:49.810
I'll leave tomorrow.

12:51.140 --> 12:53.250
We'll probably be living apart.

12:56.380 --> 12:57.290
Don't go.

12:57.860 --> 12:58.650
Please.

13:01.380 --> 13:02.690
Don't leave me.

13:03.340 --> 13:04.050
Please.

13:06.860 --> 13:08.680
I know this is unfair to you.

13:09.220 --> 13:10.020
These past few days,

13:10.690 --> 13:11.690
I've tried

13:11.690 --> 13:13.471
to make it up to you
as much as I could.

13:14.780 --> 13:15.860
I promise

13:16.620 --> 13:18.050
whenever I get home leave,

13:18.290 --> 13:19.260
I'll come back.

13:19.380 --> 13:20.020
Okay?

13:23.600 --> 13:24.720
Yan...

13:26.810 --> 13:27.690
Yan...

13:28.890 --> 13:29.770
I'm sorry.

13:30.930 --> 13:32.340
I'm really sorry.

13:33.930 --> 13:35.410
I did my best,

13:35.410 --> 13:36.810
but I'm useless. I...

13:39.290 --> 13:40.670
I couldn't save you.

13:42.590 --> 13:43.270
Yan...

13:43.500 --> 13:44.340
I'm sorry...

13:44.340 --> 13:44.890
I...

13:45.540 --> 13:46.810
I saved so many people,

13:47.690 --> 13:49.090
but I couldn't save you.

13:55.460 --> 13:56.810
If only

13:57.530 --> 13:58.500
you could've lived.

14:01.770 --> 14:02.693
Yan...

14:05.610 --> 14:07.050
Don't leave me...

14:10.190 --> 14:11.590
Don't leave me.

14:15.050 --> 14:16.170
Don't leave me.

14:17.530 --> 14:18.650
Don't leave me...

14:26.530 --> 14:27.160
No...

14:28.930 --> 14:29.860
No, Yan...

14:33.020 --> 14:33.871
Yan...

14:51.620 --> 14:56.660
(Qu Hua)

15:10.620 --> 15:11.460
This won't do.

15:11.530 --> 15:12.500
I need to change it.

15:12.930 --> 15:13.740
Change it.

15:15.715 --> 15:16.515
How about this?

15:17.140 --> 15:17.750
Let me try.

17:47.290 --> 17:49.100
(Qu Hua, today I'm taking the train.)

17:49.100 --> 17:51.180
(I've been transferred with
the team to Jiangcheng University.)

17:51.180 --> 17:51.980
(Wishing you well.)

17:52.420 --> 17:52.800
(Also,)

17:53.100 --> 17:54.740
(Yan and I do look alike.)

18:11.500 --> 18:12.320
Fang Mujing!

18:13.100 --> 18:13.900
Fang Mujing!

18:15.680 --> 18:16.320
Fang Mujing!

18:19.520 --> 18:20.420
Fang Mujing!

18:22.300 --> 18:29.060
(Jiangnan)

19:04.508 --> 19:06.400
I wanted a new TV.

19:06.500 --> 19:08.380
This one's obviously old.

19:09.020 --> 19:10.560
Who knows if it works?

19:11.330 --> 19:13.071
Fang Muyang, are you messing with me?

19:13.093 --> 19:14.020
Chief Wang,

19:14.570 --> 19:15.690
I wouldn't dare.

19:16.330 --> 19:18.760
Yes, it's not new,

19:19.940 --> 19:21.060
but I guarantee it works.

19:21.500 --> 19:22.390
Not only does it work,

19:22.493 --> 19:23.550
but it also looks great.

19:24.850 --> 19:25.530
Turn this knob.

19:25.810 --> 19:26.400
This one?

19:26.500 --> 19:27.810
To the right.

19:27.810 --> 19:28.470
Slowly.

19:28.660 --> 19:29.130
Okay.

19:29.910 --> 19:31.220
Hear that?

19:34.530 --> 19:35.070
There.

19:35.530 --> 19:37.460
It's on!

19:39.220 --> 19:40.020
That's great!

19:40.090 --> 19:40.740
It's on!

19:41.850 --> 19:42.660
Great!

19:43.420 --> 19:44.260
It's on!

20:05.130 --> 20:05.700
Well...

20:05.940 --> 20:06.850
About the money,

20:07.248 --> 20:08.460
we won't talk about it now.

20:09.810 --> 20:11.260
But there's nothing on the screen.

20:23.160 --> 20:24.570
We forgot the most important thing.

20:25.570 --> 20:27.130
If you don't pull out the antenna,

20:27.130 --> 20:28.500
how will it get a signal?

20:31.660 --> 20:32.570
There's a man!

20:33.090 --> 20:33.900
A man on screen!

20:33.900 --> 20:34.500
Look, Fei Ni!

20:34.570 --> 20:35.604
There's a man on screen.

20:35.860 --> 20:36.480
A man.

20:36.600 --> 20:37.200
Everyone.

20:37.220 --> 20:38.870
- Come to Chief Wang's unit to watch TV!
- There's a man.

20:38.871 --> 20:39.740
Look.

20:40.460 --> 20:41.460
It's quite clear.

20:41.460 --> 20:42.520
Come on.

20:42.650 --> 20:43.900
Quick.

20:44.360 --> 20:45.020
Look.

20:45.890 --> 20:46.690
That's great.

20:47.260 --> 20:48.420
This is television?

20:48.790 --> 20:49.920
Peking Opera.

20:49.920 --> 20:50.980
Come watch.

20:50.980 --> 20:52.130
Watch it like this.

20:53.460 --> 20:54.770
Sit on the chair.

20:55.050 --> 20:56.860
I'll bring you chairs.

20:56.860 --> 20:57.510
Chairs.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.220
Chairs.

20:59.220 --> 21:00.130
I'll help you.

21:01.810 --> 21:02.570
Chief Wang,

21:02.570 --> 21:03.460
my brother...

21:05.090 --> 21:06.940
I'll give you the money for the TV.

21:07.671 --> 21:09.780
About your brother's job,
I can only recommend him.

21:10.250 --> 21:12.460
The final decision rests with
the factory leaders.

21:12.460 --> 21:13.390
Thank you, Chief Wang.

21:13.648 --> 21:14.770
- Chairs. Chairs.
- Alright.

21:14.890 --> 21:15.840
How's the picture?

21:16.570 --> 21:17.220
Come.

21:18.530 --> 21:20.020
Come. Sit and watch.

21:20.020 --> 21:21.130
Come. Sit.

21:22.130 --> 21:23.290
Watch this.

21:23.290 --> 21:24.980
It's my first time watching TV.

21:24.980 --> 21:25.810
Really?

21:25.810 --> 21:26.460
Here.

21:26.460 --> 21:29.050
Have some sunflower seeds.

21:30.850 --> 21:31.810
Nice.

21:39.120 --> 21:40.510
Thank you.

21:40.900 --> 21:42.470
Come on.

21:55.900 --> 21:59.740
(Welcome New Comrades!)

21:59.740 --> 22:02.700
(Jiangcheng University)

22:02.710 --> 22:03.420
Zhou.

22:04.940 --> 22:05.610
Professor Wu,

22:05.900 --> 22:06.850
you've finally arrived.

22:07.020 --> 22:08.260
Welcome!

22:08.570 --> 22:09.260
Zhou,

22:09.460 --> 22:10.880
I've bought my whole team

22:10.980 --> 22:11.900
over to your side.

22:13.090 --> 22:14.900
I was counting the days.

22:14.900 --> 22:16.900
You've finally bought your talents here.

22:18.420 --> 22:19.810
Help with the luggage.

22:19.848 --> 22:21.460
- This way, Professor Wu.
- I'll take it.

22:21.460 --> 22:22.540
It's fine. I've got it.

22:29.020 --> 22:29.570
Mujing,

22:30.050 --> 22:32.180
I'd heard Jiangcheng University
was beautiful.

22:32.850 --> 22:35.020
It truly lives up to its reputation.

22:35.820 --> 22:39.780
(Jiangcheng College
Teaching Building No. 1)

22:39.780 --> 22:41.660
(Welcome New Comrades!)

22:41.660 --> 22:42.500
Fang Muyang,

22:42.500 --> 22:43.980
you're amazing.

22:44.610 --> 22:45.050
Come.

22:45.700 --> 22:47.260
You can even build a TV.

22:47.810 --> 22:50.770
Since you were little,
Ms. Chen said you were smart,

22:50.770 --> 22:52.290
but you never put it to good use.

22:52.290 --> 22:53.220
Let me.

22:54.460 --> 22:56.290
You're not some kind of genius, are you?

23:00.180 --> 23:00.700
Fang Muyang,

23:02.500 --> 23:03.850
how can I ever thank you?

23:03.893 --> 23:04.960
If it weren't for you,

23:04.960 --> 23:06.500
my brother wouldn't have gotten the job.

23:07.290 --> 23:08.660
I'll treat you to a meal.

23:09.090 --> 23:10.500
Didn't you always want

23:10.500 --> 23:12.220
steak and ice cream?

23:13.315 --> 23:15.420
We'd have to go to
Deda Western Restaurant.

23:16.204 --> 23:17.770
Maybe we can order a bottle of red wine.

23:18.980 --> 23:19.500
Uh...

23:23.090 --> 23:24.020
How about this?

23:24.290 --> 23:26.180
I'll make you a new outfit.

23:27.570 --> 23:28.980
Can I have

23:29.420 --> 23:30.180
both of them?

23:38.740 --> 23:39.290
I'm kidding.

23:40.050 --> 23:40.850
Actually,

23:40.937 --> 23:42.370
I have a way that doesn't cost money.

23:43.570 --> 23:44.460
What is it?

23:44.700 --> 23:45.610
Give me a kiss.

23:56.850 --> 23:57.850
I was joking.

23:57.915 --> 23:58.460
I didn't...

24:06.570 --> 24:07.850
I'm going out.

24:32.460 --> 24:33.090
Calm down.

24:33.700 --> 24:34.370
Calm down.

24:35.460 --> 24:37.260
I only did that to thank him

24:38.260 --> 24:39.420
and to save money.

24:41.260 --> 24:43.090
Everything happened too fast.

24:56.020 --> 24:57.160
Fei Ni, just now, I...

24:57.160 --> 24:58.260
Fang Muyang.

24:58.980 --> 25:01.740
That was simply
my way of returning a favor.

25:01.740 --> 25:02.750
Don't misunderstand.

25:03.850 --> 25:05.400
We should

25:05.770 --> 25:06.800
keep some distance

25:07.026 --> 25:08.460
and treat each other with courtesy.

25:11.660 --> 25:12.120
Alright.

25:13.700 --> 25:14.400
As you say.

25:29.460 --> 25:30.770
Would you like to sit?

25:31.290 --> 25:32.700
No.

25:33.770 --> 25:34.530
It's time.

25:34.530 --> 25:36.810
I'm going to the canteen.

25:37.460 --> 25:38.460
I'll get your lunch box.

25:44.420 --> 25:46.980
Thank you, Comrade Fang Muyang...

25:47.260 --> 25:48.050
You're welcome.

25:48.700 --> 25:49.500
Comrade Fei Ni.

26:02.610 --> 26:03.280
Well...

26:04.940 --> 26:05.500
Please.

26:07.770 --> 26:09.260
I need my meal ticket.

26:10.440 --> 26:11.110
Yes, please.

26:24.370 --> 26:25.570
See you, Comrade Fei Ni.

26:31.590 --> 26:33.030
See you, Comrade Fang Muyang.

26:35.850 --> 26:36.460
Let me.

26:36.460 --> 26:37.090
You go ahead.

26:37.090 --> 26:37.700
Alright.

27:34.460 --> 27:39.420
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

27:45.220 --> 27:46.370
What are we promoting next?

27:46.370 --> 27:47.750
That textile worker story.

27:49.010 --> 27:50.460
Excuse me.

27:57.660 --> 27:58.180
Here you go.

27:58.460 --> 27:59.520
Just leave it here.

27:59.700 --> 28:00.610
We'll share it.

28:00.610 --> 28:01.460
See you.

28:01.570 --> 28:02.220
Zhao.

28:02.220 --> 28:02.610
Come.

28:02.610 --> 28:03.090
Chief Wang.

28:03.460 --> 28:03.980
What's it?

28:03.980 --> 28:05.570
Check this draft one more time.

28:05.570 --> 28:06.020
Okay.

28:06.020 --> 28:07.050
Send it to Ms. Xu quickly.

28:07.050 --> 28:07.980
Sure, no problem.

28:11.090 --> 28:11.900
Report!

28:13.560 --> 28:14.610
Who are you looking for?

28:14.870 --> 28:17.360
Former educated youth Fei Ting,
from Second Company, Third Squad,

28:17.360 --> 28:19.660
29th Regiment of Helongjiang
Production and Construction Corps,

28:19.660 --> 28:20.850
reporting for duty.

28:20.850 --> 28:22.570
Awaiting instructions, Madam!

28:22.980 --> 28:24.000
Comrade Fei Ting is here.

28:24.420 --> 28:25.500
There's no madam here.

28:25.700 --> 28:26.600
We're all comrades.

28:27.420 --> 28:28.040
Come on.

28:28.500 --> 28:29.510
Let me introduce you.

28:29.770 --> 28:30.530
This is

28:30.530 --> 28:31.810
the new officer

28:31.810 --> 28:33.850
in our Publicity Department,
Comrade Fei Ting.

28:33.980 --> 28:35.337
Let's welcome him with applause.

28:39.290 --> 28:41.040
Fei Ting,
that'll be your desk from now on.

28:42.050 --> 28:42.730
Yes.

28:49.048 --> 28:54.382
(Notes)

29:02.890 --> 29:03.540
Ye Feng,

29:04.360 --> 29:05.340
I borrowed all these

29:05.340 --> 29:06.610
from the college library for you.

29:06.810 --> 29:08.720
Island Female Militia is really good.

29:08.900 --> 29:09.910
You'll like it.

29:10.220 --> 29:12.220
You've seen the movie
Sparkling Red Star.

29:12.220 --> 29:13.470
This is the novel.

29:13.600 --> 29:14.590
Also very good.

29:26.350 --> 29:27.930
Here are two sports books.

29:27.982 --> 29:29.337
I borrowed these for you, too.

29:30.260 --> 29:30.770
Let me see.

29:31.780 --> 29:32.700
(Basketball)

29:48.180 --> 29:49.500
What happened to your arm?

29:50.410 --> 29:51.050
Nothing.

29:51.420 --> 29:52.920
Those two books

29:52.920 --> 29:53.850
were shelved too high.

29:54.050 --> 29:56.500
I climbed a ladder to get them and fell.

29:56.650 --> 29:57.370
I got a scrape.

29:57.937 --> 29:59.460
Why didn't you put medicine on it?

30:00.937 --> 30:03.219
I was worried you couldn't wait
if I took too long,

30:03.220 --> 30:04.360
so I didn't bother.

30:10.260 --> 30:11.050
Give me a second.

30:28.360 --> 30:29.210
Does it still hurt?

30:30.130 --> 30:30.980
It's fine.

30:33.937 --> 30:34.830
Take this medicine

30:35.570 --> 30:36.330
with you.

30:36.604 --> 30:38.382
Keep applying it when you get home.

30:41.130 --> 30:41.840
It's all my fault.

30:43.382 --> 30:45.080
Had I known
you didn't like reading those,

30:45.490 --> 30:47.220
I wouldn't have climbed up to get them.

30:49.460 --> 30:50.330
I do like them.

30:50.715 --> 30:52.782
I'll start reading them
as soon as I get home.

30:55.180 --> 30:55.710
Ye Feng.

30:57.660 --> 30:58.550
I like you.

31:07.660 --> 31:09.020
You're good at basketball,

31:09.020 --> 31:10.020
kind-hearted,

31:10.020 --> 31:11.460
and have a strong sense of justice.

31:12.810 --> 31:15.020
I do have quite a few strengths.

31:15.770 --> 31:16.710
You're not bad either.

31:16.871 --> 31:18.530
You're a college student, well-educated,

31:18.826 --> 31:20.004
with a good personality,

31:20.810 --> 31:21.740
and beautiful.

31:23.420 --> 31:24.260
But

31:24.530 --> 31:26.300
I'm not as good as Fei Ni, right?

31:32.810 --> 31:34.850
Fei Ni is like these sports books.

31:35.370 --> 31:36.310
(Basketball)
Thin,

31:36.310 --> 31:37.570
but everyone likes them.

31:38.050 --> 31:40.670
And I'm like these literature books.

31:41.660 --> 31:43.020
Well-written,

31:43.370 --> 31:44.810
but left high up on the shelf.

31:50.330 --> 31:51.130
Ye Feng.

31:53.360 --> 31:54.460
Can you tell me

31:55.400 --> 31:56.770
why you loathe me?

31:58.940 --> 31:59.280
I...

32:00.220 --> 32:01.430
I don't loathe you.

32:03.260 --> 32:05.530
I just don't like my mom
pushing you onto me.

32:06.370 --> 32:07.570
If she hadn't interfered,

32:07.940 --> 32:09.610
I might not have broken up with Fei Ni.

32:10.660 --> 32:11.460
Ye Feng,

32:12.130 --> 32:13.660
you don't have to like me,

32:13.850 --> 32:15.460
but you can't look down on me.

32:16.060 --> 32:17.440
Why do you mean "push me onto you"?

32:17.660 --> 32:18.610
I'm a person,

32:18.810 --> 32:20.540
not some object.

32:21.810 --> 32:22.370
Yes.

32:23.130 --> 32:24.200
I like you.

32:25.300 --> 32:27.180
But you can't treat me like this.

32:29.570 --> 32:31.630
That's not what I meant.

32:32.820 --> 32:33.700
I'm sorry, Ling Yi.

32:34.020 --> 32:35.030
Don't be angry.

32:36.050 --> 32:36.710
Well,

32:36.940 --> 32:38.180
I'm not good with words.

32:42.420 --> 32:43.660
Don't cry, okay?

32:45.420 --> 32:46.660
Guess I was deluding myself.

32:49.570 --> 32:50.370
Ye Feng,

32:51.180 --> 32:52.500
let's stop seeing each other.

32:53.130 --> 32:53.660
Goodbye.

32:59.050 --> 32:59.660
Ling Yi.

33:09.530 --> 33:10.980
I used to see only Fei Ni

33:11.626 --> 33:13.460
and overlooked someone
as excellent as you.

33:16.530 --> 33:16.900
Ling Yi,

33:18.330 --> 33:19.290
be my girlfriend.

33:23.893 --> 33:25.260
Have you thought it through?

33:25.460 --> 33:26.160
Yes, I have.

33:28.260 --> 33:29.610
I think my mom was right.

33:30.448 --> 33:32.130
You're no inferior to Fei Ni at all.

33:32.980 --> 33:34.260
And you treat me so well.

33:34.810 --> 33:36.180
If I don't like you,

33:36.610 --> 33:37.770
I'd be blind.

34:20.020 --> 34:21.420
Why aren't you wearing clothes?

34:22.650 --> 34:24.050
I was washing up.

34:24.050 --> 34:25.300
Look. I hung up a curtain.

34:25.300 --> 34:26.130
No. I'm not looking.

34:26.130 --> 34:27.340
Put your clothes on already.

34:27.900 --> 34:28.980
I've put them on.

34:31.250 --> 34:32.020
This

34:32.020 --> 34:33.820
will be our private bathroom.

34:34.340 --> 34:35.130
Look at this space.

34:35.515 --> 34:36.420
Not for a full wash,

34:36.420 --> 34:37.671
but it's fine for wiping down.

34:38.250 --> 34:39.130
Want to try?

34:46.380 --> 34:47.170
Don't worry.

34:47.650 --> 34:48.860
I'll wait outside.

35:07.050 --> 35:07.520
Fang.

35:08.980 --> 35:09.570
Chief Cao.

35:09.693 --> 35:11.826
Did you tick your wife off
and get kicked out?

35:13.650 --> 35:14.690
It's cooler outside.

35:31.460 --> 35:32.380
I'm done washing.

35:34.940 --> 35:36.640
That space is really good.

35:36.730 --> 35:38.210
But if the curtain were a bit taller,

35:38.210 --> 35:40.090
it'd be better.

35:50.530 --> 35:51.090
What...

35:52.570 --> 35:53.620
are you looking at?

36:01.440 --> 36:02.080
Fang Muyang.

36:03.990 --> 36:04.770
Fang Muyang.

36:11.300 --> 36:12.210
It's wet here.

36:16.300 --> 36:17.020
I...

36:17.020 --> 36:18.130
I'll pour out the water.

36:43.610 --> 36:45.380
Fei Ting, have some meat.

36:46.730 --> 36:47.650
Thank you, Mrs. Lin.

36:48.700 --> 36:49.500
You're welcome.

36:51.210 --> 36:51.840
Fei Ting,

36:52.515 --> 36:54.630
you really got into
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory?

36:56.090 --> 36:57.700
It's not the factory.

36:58.050 --> 37:00.920
The Publicity Department.

37:01.500 --> 37:02.730
He'll be handling the writing.

37:03.610 --> 37:05.460
I told you all along
Fei Ting had the ability.

37:05.460 --> 37:06.460
You didn't believe me.

37:07.380 --> 37:08.610
Look at this girl.

37:08.610 --> 37:09.980
She doesn't know how to talk.

37:09.980 --> 37:12.420
When did we ever say he didn't?

37:12.420 --> 37:14.300
We just had expectations.

37:14.300 --> 37:15.980
That was for your own good.

37:15.980 --> 37:16.860
Am I right, Fei Ting?

37:16.980 --> 37:17.650
Yes.

37:17.650 --> 37:19.460
Your mom and dad mean well.

37:19.860 --> 37:20.820
Right.

37:22.650 --> 37:25.050
Dad, Mom, as we agreed before.

37:25.610 --> 37:27.250
Once Fei Ting found a job,

37:27.250 --> 37:28.380
you'd agree to our marriage.

37:34.170 --> 37:35.860
Aunt can't marry him!

37:37.420 --> 37:38.250
Why not?

37:38.420 --> 37:39.570
My mom said

37:39.570 --> 37:41.250
if Aunt marries him,

37:41.250 --> 37:43.570
there'll be no hope for Dad's transfer.

37:45.090 --> 37:47.380
Aunt has to marry someone
with connections.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.680
Do you have connections?

37:50.540 --> 37:51.250
Lin Jianshe,

37:51.250 --> 37:52.493
what are you talking about?

37:52.610 --> 37:53.530
I'm not lying.

37:53.530 --> 37:54.980
I heard you say it.

37:54.980 --> 37:56.340
Don't talk nonsense.

37:57.130 --> 37:57.820
Go inside.

37:59.300 --> 38:00.940
Fang Aihong, don't scold him.

38:01.980 --> 38:03.130
Eat the dishes, Fei Ting.

38:11.610 --> 38:12.690
Come on.

38:12.980 --> 38:13.640
Fei Ting.

38:14.580 --> 38:17.040
Your job is settled.

38:17.693 --> 38:20.426
But how many legs do you have?
[* Refer to the quantity of furniture.]

38:23.610 --> 38:24.500
I have

38:25.690 --> 38:26.440
two.

38:29.730 --> 38:31.610
Not those two legs.

38:32.050 --> 38:33.050
We mean,

38:33.050 --> 38:34.430
if you're marrying Lin Mei,

38:34.500 --> 38:36.020
you need to prepare furniture, right?

38:36.250 --> 38:37.300
Lin Mei

38:37.570 --> 38:38.410
is so outstanding.

38:38.860 --> 38:41.020
Shouldn't there be
at least thirty-six legs?

38:41.420 --> 38:43.860
Dad, Mom, that's enough.

38:44.210 --> 38:45.420
Are you centipedes?

38:45.420 --> 38:46.780
What do you need so many legs for?

38:47.020 --> 38:48.250
Can the house even fit that much?

38:48.271 --> 38:50.115
If it doesn't,
I'll hang them from the beams.

38:50.420 --> 38:51.250
Yeah.

38:52.090 --> 38:52.610
Fei Ting,

38:53.248 --> 38:55.350
that's the rule when our family
marries off a daughter.

38:55.780 --> 38:56.650
But don't worry.

38:57.115 --> 38:58.130
Once the legs are ready,

38:58.530 --> 39:00.260
the wedding's on.

39:03.170 --> 39:03.980
What rule is that?

39:04.448 --> 39:06.130
You're making things hard for Fei Ting.

39:06.230 --> 39:07.820
You're doing all these

39:07.940 --> 39:09.250
to set me up with Wang Tengda,

39:09.337 --> 39:11.420
so he'll transfer my brother
to the transport team.

39:11.980 --> 39:13.050
Let me tell you.

39:13.130 --> 39:14.460
Give up on that idea.

39:15.093 --> 39:16.850
How can you talk
to your parents like that?

39:17.170 --> 39:19.020
Don't make it sound like
we're harming you.

39:19.250 --> 39:20.460
With Wang Tengda's condition,

39:20.460 --> 39:21.170
if I hadn't

39:21.170 --> 39:23.380
praised you in front of him,

39:23.380 --> 39:24.940
he might not even have looked at you.

39:24.940 --> 39:26.650
Perfect. Turtle matches mung bean.

39:26.650 --> 39:28.089
Rotten fish matches rotten shrimp.

39:28.090 --> 39:29.380
I like Fei Ting exactly as he is.

39:29.380 --> 39:29.730
Mom.

39:30.650 --> 39:31.780
You're a young lady.

39:31.780 --> 39:33.380
Don't sound so harsh.

39:33.380 --> 39:34.760
Your talk sounds nice, doesn't it?

39:34.860 --> 39:35.730
One month.

39:40.980 --> 39:42.130
Give me a month.

39:42.530 --> 39:43.610
All the thirty-six legs.

39:44.210 --> 39:45.200
Not one will be missing.

40:00.170 --> 40:01.300
Sit down and eat.

40:01.460 --> 40:02.300
Have some meat.

40:02.360 --> 40:02.940
Have some meat.

40:02.940 --> 40:04.500
Here, eat the meat.

40:21.940 --> 40:23.650
Did you see their faces just now?

40:23.860 --> 40:24.900
So satisfying.

40:25.380 --> 40:26.650
You should've shown

40:26.650 --> 40:28.020
that spirit earlier.

40:28.340 --> 40:30.170
Otherwise, they'd think
you're a pushover.

40:35.250 --> 40:36.380
Don't worry yet.

40:36.515 --> 40:37.820
I thought about it just now.

40:38.130 --> 40:39.540
They said thirty-six legs,

40:39.610 --> 40:41.180
but they didn't specify which legs.

40:41.650 --> 40:43.120
We could make ten little stools.

40:43.610 --> 40:44.530
That's forty legs.

40:44.530 --> 40:45.690
Four extra for them.

40:45.690 --> 40:46.650
That won't do.

40:49.340 --> 40:49.810
Lin Mei,

40:50.610 --> 40:52.380
your parents were right about one thing.

40:53.115 --> 40:54.430
Marriage is a serious matter.

40:54.493 --> 40:56.248
I want you to marry with dignity.

40:57.530 --> 40:58.650
I want that, too.

40:58.650 --> 41:00.115
But where are we going to get those?

41:02.610 --> 41:03.730
Fei Ting,

41:03.937 --> 41:05.582
if I have to wait another year or more

41:05.604 --> 41:06.820
because of this,

41:06.820 --> 41:07.050
I...

41:07.050 --> 41:07.937
That won't happen.

41:09.380 --> 41:10.570
I'll tell you the truth.

41:10.730 --> 41:12.460
After I came to propose last time,

41:12.460 --> 41:14.530
I called the secretary of  Qianjin Farm

41:14.530 --> 41:15.871
and asked him to get some lumber.

41:16.530 --> 41:17.900
I figured

41:17.900 --> 41:19.420
with the money I had,

41:19.730 --> 41:21.210
I couldn't manage thirty-six legs.

41:21.210 --> 41:23.610
But if I could manage twenty-four,

41:23.980 --> 41:25.300
it would at least be decent.

41:25.300 --> 41:27.170
You used all your savings on lumber?

41:27.780 --> 41:29.230
Are you silly?

41:29.780 --> 41:31.530
You endured so much hardship and hunger

41:31.530 --> 41:33.380
all those years
in Great Northern Wilderness

41:33.380 --> 41:34.780
just to save that little money.

41:34.780 --> 41:36.340
- You...
- That's not a big deal.

41:36.340 --> 41:37.980
I saved it for our wedding anyway.

41:38.730 --> 41:39.980
What worries me now

41:40.570 --> 41:41.980
is that thirty-six legs.

41:42.380 --> 41:43.760
I haven't saved enough.

41:46.650 --> 41:47.590
I have some.

41:47.826 --> 41:48.940
I'll withdraw it tomorrow.

41:48.940 --> 41:49.570
No.

41:49.730 --> 41:50.980
I can't take your money.

41:51.570 --> 41:53.500
Aren't we family?

41:53.820 --> 41:54.500
At this point,

41:54.500 --> 41:56.048
why keep yours and mine separate?

41:56.820 --> 41:57.350
Lin Mei,

41:58.210 --> 41:59.790
I don't care how your parents see me.

41:59.826 --> 42:01.293
But as their future son-in-law,

42:01.293 --> 42:02.390
I want them to believe

42:02.570 --> 42:03.900
I can give you a good life.

42:04.380 --> 42:05.160
So

42:05.380 --> 42:06.500
I have to solve it myself.

42:11.860 --> 42:12.900
Didn't I say?

42:13.170 --> 42:14.050
At most one month.

42:14.337 --> 42:15.448
Have a little faith in me.

42:16.900 --> 42:18.500
I've always had faith in you.

42:20.500 --> 42:21.860
Don't let people see.

42:22.650 --> 42:23.500
Let them see.

42:23.500 --> 42:24.460
Who cares?

42:31.210 --> 42:32.130
I saved this

42:32.690 --> 42:34.500
for your wedding.

42:35.050 --> 42:36.170
Use it first.

42:38.820 --> 42:39.280
Ting,

42:40.093 --> 42:42.240
this is the money Mom and Dad
saved for my wedding.

42:42.900 --> 42:44.980
After buying furniture,

42:45.380 --> 42:48.690
there are forty left. It's not much.

43:04.500 --> 43:05.300
Wait.

43:05.900 --> 43:07.130
Why are you all looking at me?

43:08.170 --> 43:10.420
My money's all with your mom.

43:10.780 --> 43:11.300
Dad,

43:12.530 --> 43:13.210
that one...

43:13.210 --> 43:14.680
Which one?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
